</code></pre> Example: out_of_range.409 exception <p>The example shows how serializing a JSON object whose key contains a null byte (U+0000) throws an exception, because BSON keys are null-terminated C strings and cannot contain U+0000 themselves.</p> <pre><code>#include &lt;iostream&gt;
