Example: Disabled behavior <p>The code below forces the library not to create default serialization/deserialization functions <code>from_json</code> and <code>to_json</code>, meaning the code below does not compile.</p> <pre><code>#define JSON_DISABLE_ENUM_SERIALIZATION 1
